  "description": "*“I mean, I have a crush on this actor.”*\n\nYun-Sang lands a role in \"Aftermath\", the latest drama from Nflix Korea. His character’s love interest is none other than Dohwan, a genius actor from the indie film scene whom Yun-Sang has secretly admired for years. But the man himself turns out to be utterly impossible to read…?! \n\nPlayful yet serious, sweet yet rude, Do-Hwan is a free spirit who leaves Yun-Sang completely at his mercy. So much for his nickname, “Prince Alpha”! A hopeless romantic who falls hard and fast, Yun-Sang finds himself hopelessly caught up in Do-Hwan’s orbit. Do-Hwan gives just enough to keep Yun-Sang guessing, never quite crossing the line. They play sworn enemies on screen, yet he finds himself asking Do-Hwan out the moment the cameras stop rolling. He plays Do-Hwan’s omega, but in real life, pheromones don’t work on him at all. Love, fueled by pride and sheer stubbornness! Can Yun-Sang win the heart of an untouchable acting genius? He’s got a reputation as Hollywood’s Casanova, but just you wait—I’ll make him fall head over heels for me!\n\n(Source: Manta, edited)",
